          "title": "You'll want to know: कपास",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "कपास — kapās — \"cotton (the plant, the raw fibre)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "किसान ने खेत में कपास बोई। Kisān ne khet meṁ kapās boī. The farmer sowed cotton in the field."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Feminine."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "कपास (kapās) is a tadbhava, inherited from Sanskrit karpāsa, \"the cotton plant\" (CDIAL 2877)."
            }
          ]
        },
